 horror experience."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PHANTOM PLAYHOUSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This playable demo lets you experience the second night of <i>Phantom Playhouse</i>, a horror and survival adventure featuring deadly animatronics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866440/extras/48e69c3e9caae2aba2ad29cbd551b161.poster.avif?t=1752747563\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866440/extras/48e69c3e9caae2aba2ad29cbd551b161.webm?t=1752747563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866440/extras/48e69c3e9caae2aba2ad29cbd551b161.mp4?t=1752747563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>In this trial version you will be able to:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive the game\u2019s second night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Encounter three active animatronics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use the flashlight to explore the darkness</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers approximately 15 to 20 minutes of gameplay and introduces the core mechanics of the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866440/extras/cfe921c377656fe38b5f0901ce768df6.poster.avif?t=1752747563\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866440/extras/cfe921c377656fe38b5f0901ce768df6.webm?t=1752747563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3866440/extras/cfe921c377656fe38b5f0